{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Betty used a calculator to find the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/0/fd00ee3cdd0c698ba34f149bf78dd8e1f446938d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.075 \\times 2.56$\" width=\"95\" height=\"12\" />.  She forgot to enter the decimal points.  The calculator showed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/3/0836eef1a04352a8e60d3818842b605ee499face.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19200$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />.  If Betty had entered the decimal points correctly, the answer would have been\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/9/a79c0a46a40eb7f37b3b08f1964c6367207525de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ .0192 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ .192 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 1.92 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 19.2 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 192$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"453\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Betty calculated <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/f/d2ff3d47ce123d2bb7f9c05819849007a0ca8366.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75 \\times 256 = 19200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />, when she should have calculated <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/d/0bd41ac3cc15088f1b02f8cae9f18843bc9734b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{75}{1000}\\times\\frac{256}{100} = \\frac{19200}{100000} = \\frac{192}{1000} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ .192}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"345\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/a/23a34e76103580f699f56756f00a142dbdf0ac83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.075$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> decimal places and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/e/c0eb318be53f46b7d2be2e2c46a88e1e8a332fd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> decimal places, the decimal point in the product should be moved <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/d/efd511c1545dc62444789b5e1f7ec0c0fec0b442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+2=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> places to the left.  Therefore, the correct product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84aa2e57844e3db5fa54cec411ffd798077c6bab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.19200 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ .192}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"154\" height=\"30\" />.  \n</p><p>~ algebraic_algorithmic, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" title=\"1988 AJHSME\">1988 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width